  "description": "Antisemitism is a long-standing form of prejudice and discrimination against Jewish people, often rooted in conspiracy theories, stereotypes, and false accusations. The meme relies on this historical and social phenomenon to deliver its hateful message. Understanding antisemitism is essential to recognizing the offensive nature of the stereotype and the intent behind the meme.",
